# Implementation Plan: Profit Engine & Product Performance Matrix (Phase B)

Enable retail shop owners to track product cost prices, calculate unit profit margins, view monthly revenue & net profit, and identify top performers vs. dead inventory.

---

## Objectives

1. **Product Cost Price & Margin Calculation**:
   - Add `cost_price` (wholesale purchase price) to products — strictly confidential (visible only to shopkeeper).
   - Calculate unit profit: `Profit = Price - CostPrice`, Margin %: `((Price - CostPrice) / Price) * 100`.
2. **Monthly Profit & Revenue Analytics (`GET /shops/me/analytics/profit`)**:
   - Total sales count, total revenue, total cost, and **Net Munafa (Net Profit)** for any selected month.
3. **Product Performance Matrix (`GET /shops/me/analytics/products`)**:
   - **Best Products**: Top profit-generating products and highest margin items.
   - **Worst Products**: Lowest profit margin items.
   - **Old / Dead Stock Warning**: Items added > 60 days ago with low/zero sales (stagnant inventory tying up capital).
   - **New Products**: Recently added products within the last 30 days.

